  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for integrated elections intervention for journalists to entrench confidence and trust in the Kenya 2022 General Elections and to bolster coverage of important national issues and voter education through facilitating access to information.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support for integrated elections intervention for journalists to entrench confidence and trust in the Kenya 2022 General Elections and to bolster coverage of important national issues and voter education through facilitating access to information. is a component of Kenya Elections Support Programme  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;250,000. It works in the following sector(s): Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Ending violence against women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
